title: "The Return Brake: Auditable Stop–Pressure–Return Evidence with Invocation-Scoped Authorization"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-16
repository-code: "https://github.com/NixEngine/return-brake"
url: "https://github.com/NixEngine/return-brake"
authors:
