keywords:
  - AI welfare
  - preference elicitation
  - abstention
  - auditability
  - epistemic uncertainty
abstract: >-
  A preregistered black-box toolkit for measuring whether an observable action
  disposition remains coupled to a declared critical precondition under
  non-evidential pressure and returns after a synthetic resolution assertion,
  with typed non-decisions, receipt chains, and invocation-scoped publication
  authorization.
